# Phase 5 — dashboard/: node_modules and Evidence's own build artifacts are
# reproducible from package.json + sources/, so not committed. The pruned
# openledger.duckdb (~2MB, exception above) and package-lock.json ARE
# committed — the whole point of C5.1 is that the data path is small enough
# to commit, and the lockfile is what makes Vercel's install reproducible.
dashboard/node_modules/
dashboard/.evidence/
dashboard/build/
